2. Local AI Model Weights (Ollama Runtime)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Model weights (such as `qwen3:4b` and `qwen3-vl:8b`) are NOT bundled inside
  this repository. They are downloaded directly to the local workstation by the
  end-user through Ollama (https://ollama.com).
- The Qwen model series is developed and distributed by the Qwen Team /
  Alibaba Cloud under the Apache 2.0 / Qwen Research License.
- Users are responsible for complying with all applicable upstream model
  licenses and terms of service.

